# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the unit tests (LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=...).
#
# The Graal native image is not instrumented; its allocations (isolate threads and their structures) are alive when
# the tests exit: the library never tears the isolate down. Leaks of the C++ library and of the tests are still
# reported: their allocation stacks do not pass through the native image.
leak:libDxFeedGraalNativeSdk
